{"id":"fff5dc780f29d486","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zero-function.md","title":"Zero Function $Z$","display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function $Z$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zero-function","aliases":["58-df-zero-function","58-df-Z"],"display":"df-zero-function — Zero Function $Z$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zero-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zero-function</span><span>58-df-Z</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zero-function — Zero Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z,x\\in V\">\\(Z,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Function}(Z,\\omega,\\omega)\\land Z=\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zero\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Function}(Z,\\omega,\\omega)\\land Z=\\{\\langle x,0\\rangle:x\\in\\omega\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{PR}\\)</span> 的基函数之一</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 是常值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z(x) = 0\">\\(Z(x) = 0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8997cda0865ef9b\" href=\"?note=e8997cda0865ef9b\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-successor-function.md</a> — 后继函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8a304812dec1e29f\" href=\"?note=8a304812dec1e29f\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md\">../batch11/58-df-projection-function.md</a> — 投影函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md\">../batch01/58-df-primitive-recursive.md</a> — 原始递归函数</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df